<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple EPS estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple EPS estimate cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it lowered its earnings estimate for Apple Computer Inc for fiscal 1997 to a loss of $2.68 from a loss of $1.75, excluding restructuring charges.</p>
<p>-- First Boston said it is maintaining its hold rating for Apple.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Charles Wolf said he lowered his earnings estimate for the company based on its conference call Friday, in which the company said sales would be lower than he had been forecasting.</p>
</text>
